------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. ARCHITECTURAL CONCLUSION
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The core and SoC employ:
- Direct asynchronous reset net (rst_n) with no reset controller state machine.
- Static hardwired program counter reset address at 0x00000000.
- No dynamic memory remapping (no rom_remap registers).
- No external mode strapping pins.
